2	 * Tests for pr-response/dispatch-reviewer.ts — dispatchReviewer.
3	 *
4	 * Unit tests only — no real git operations or Claude spawns. `execSync` and
5	 * `spawnSync` are mocked via vi.mock. SubProcessAdapter is mocked to avoid
6	 * subprocess spawning. Filesystem operations use real temp directories.
7	 *
8	 * Covers:
9	 *   1. dispatchReviewer — claim_lost when checkout of task branch fails
10	 *   2. dispatchReviewer — claim_lost when task status is not in_review
11	 *   3. dispatchReviewer — claim_lost when last log entry is reviewer_started
12	 *   4. dispatchReviewer — claim_lost when push of claim commit is rejected with no recovery
13	 *   5. dispatchReviewer — dispatched on successful claim + async submit
14	 *   6. dispatchReviewer — reviewer_started log entry written to task YAML on success
15	 *   7. dispatchReviewer — submitted with handleKind "review" (not "impl")
16	 *   8. dispatchReviewer — reviewer briefing references prUrl and resultPath
17	 */
